    <string name="tp_partial_title">HearPrint is partial</string>
    <string name="tp_partial_body">HearPrint has two halves. Your hearing test tunes what your ears miss, and with good hearing that is only a little. Your taste profile is the other half: about 3 minutes of questions and A/B choices on your own music, and it is where most of the difference comes from.</string>
